                            "translations": {
                                "bn": {
                                    "text": "ডেলিভারিতে কত সময় লাগে?"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "e_5",
                            "type": "text",
                            "props": {
                                "html": "<p>One to two days in the city and three to five days elsewhere. You get a tracking link as soon as your order ships.</p>"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "e_6",
                            "type": "heading",
                            "props": {
                                "text": "Can I pay on delivery?",
                                "level": 3,
                                "link": null
                            },
                            "translations": {
                                "bn": {
                                    "text": "ডেলিভারির সময় কি টাকা দেওয়া যায়?"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "e_7",
                            "type": "text",
                            "props": {
                                "html": "<p>Yes. Cash on delivery is available on every order, and you can also pay by bank transfer.</p>"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "e_8",
                            "type": "heading",
                            "props": {
                                "text": "What if something is not right?",
                                "level": 3,
                                "link": null
                            },
                            "translations": {
                                "bn": {
                                    "text": "কোনো সমস্যা হলে কী করব?"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "e_9",
                            "type": "text",
                            "props": {
                                "html": "<p>Tell us within a few days of delivery and we will exchange it or refund you.</p>"
